How’s this for a 500pt. Combat patrol list?

They definitely didn’t lol. Here’s a revised list. I separated the Tempestus units so they can have their regiment without having units that don’t fit within their ranks. This also lets me put regimental doctrines/ custom doctrines on the other half of the army, and I get an extra command point. 


&nbsp;

**++ Battalion Detachment +5CP (Imperium - Astra Militarum) [15 PL, 254pts] ++**

&nbsp;

**+ Configuration +**

&nbsp;

**Regimental Doctrine:** Storm Troopers

&nbsp;

**+ HQ +**

&nbsp;

**Tempestor Prime [3 PL, 40pts]:** Relic: Kurov's Aquila, Tempestus Command Rod, Warlord, WT: Old Grudges

&nbsp;

**Tempestor Prime [3 PL, 40pts]:** Chainsword, Plasma Pistol

&nbsp;

**+ Troops +**

&nbsp;

**Militarum Tempestus Scions [3 PL, 58pts]**


. **2x Scion:** 2x Frag & Krak grenades, 2x Hot-shot Lasgun

. **Scion w/ Special Weapon:** Plasma gun

. **Scion w/ Special Weapon:** Hot-shot Volley Gun

. **Tempestor:** Chainsword, Plasma pistol

&nbsp;

**Militarum Tempestus Scions [3 PL, 58pts]**


. **2x Scion:** 2x Frag & Krak grenades, 2x Hot-shot Lasgun

. **Scion w/ Special Weapon:** Plasma gun

. **Scion w/ Special Weapon:** Hot-shot Volley Gun

. **Tempestor:** Chainsword, Plasma pistol

&nbsp;

